check_fix.rs counts ambiguous (>=2-match) move-follow conflicts into FixPlan.mesh_conflicts and fails closed (never auto-rewrites). check::run must gate its non-zero exit on plan.mesh_conflicts > 0 at both the dry-run and apply sites, or an unresolved ambiguous move would silently exit 0 and slip past pre-commit/CI. The usize field can be ignored without any compiler error, so a new fail-closed conflict category in check_fix must be wired into both exit gates by hand.
